/*  hole-11-158862.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: DIFFERS; chance false: DIFFERS  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0):
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    Define v1 as p0.
    Insert 5 into v1.
    Return v1.
Done.
Define v2 as a series of number.
Define v3 as a series of series of number.
Pull a rabbit.
    Insert v2 into v3.
    Cast f0 on (v2).
    Item 1 of v3 becomes cast f0 on (v2).
    Pull a rabbit.
        State v3.
    Done.
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v2.
State v3.
